<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7112"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Steve_huff<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Steve_huff<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 9:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Score one for cool-headed logical conclusions <u>based on the evidence before you</u>, as opposed to so many of the unbelievable conclusions based on misunderstandings and assumptions so many reach about such things. <b>DAMN good thinking, IQ</b>. You&#39;ve certainly proven the accuracy of your screen name! Bravo! &#40;or is it Brava?&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
